thread the register-passed node ptr bx (= word[DGROUP:0x3e08], stored by the dispatcher
FUN_0000_201a/209e) + base bp (= word[DGROUP:0x3afe]).  212a additionally restores the dropped
INPUT ax feeding the DGROUP:0x584 driver method.  These are dispatched by register (bx/bp live),
which the __allregs indirect-call model cannot thread -> param_1/param_2 arrived as garbage host
pointers (SIGSEGV in 212a).  Asm-verified engine 0x2112/0x211d/0x2123/0x212a.
